CM_ SG_ 1292 Data_B2 "[conf=low] [src=MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:18 KOES (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus, captures/2020-mscan src22GEX); bench 0x5xx HVAC+DCSM log 2020-06-12 (bench modules, origin unknown); forum 2020 (electro-tech-online 158834)] Always 00 seen.";
CM_ BO_ 1319 "[conf=medium] [src=MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:18 KOES (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus, captures/2020-mscan src22GEX); bench 0x5xx HVAC+DCSM log 2020-06-12 (bench modules, origin unknown); forum 2020 (electro-tech-online 158834)] Network-management ring, sender node 0x27. Truck ring order 01->03->0B->0C->27->3B->41->01 (successor of this node: 0x3B). Ring hop ~200 ms per node. Bench 2020-06-12: 527 01 12 00 (to Bo tool node 01). Node 0x27 = DCSM by elimination (06-04/06-10 benches had only node 03 = HVAC), medium. With 3A0 but no node 01 (06-12 19:46), 03 and 27 form their own ring (503 27 02 / 527 03 12) but 527 03 14 (LimpHome+SleepInd) breaks it every ~8-10 s and it re-forms; final 527 03 32 = SleepInd+SleepAck ~5.4 s after 3A0 stopped.";
