CM_ BO_ 1411 "[conf=low] [src=bench wake-set replay 2020-06-04 (bench module(s), origin unknown; captures/2020-mscan src22FF)] Seen once on the 2020-06-04 bench, 60 ms after wake: 583 00 (DLC 1), from the waking node 03 (inferred). On 2020-06-10 Bo transmitted 583 03 01 00 at 200 ms as a test: no keep-awake effect. The 0x581/0x583 frames in the truck logs are bit-flipped 0x501/0x503 copies, not this.";
