CM_ BO_ 1126 "[conf=low] [src=MS candump 2020-06-02 19:18 KOES (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus, captures/2020-mscan src22GEX)] Event bursts on the truck (19:18 KOES log): 10-20 identical copies ~1 ms apart, once per second for ~3 s, payload 10 48 Dx 5B C6 60 A0 00 with b2 D0->D4->D8; 19:16 log had 10 3C 38 53 C6 60 A0 00 once. Repeated copies suggest retransmissions (unverified). Not a bit-flip of 0x426 (different payload).";
